      </title-group>
      <pub-date pub-type="collection"><year>2022</year></pub-date>
      <pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>3</day><month>5</month><year>2021</year></pub-date>
      <abstract>
        <p>We show that kinase XYZ drives drug resistance <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B1">1</xref>.</p>
      </abstract>
